/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can customize which POI supercategories are announced by What's Around Me and What's Ahead of Me." = "Pode personalizar as supercategorias de POI anunciadas por O que está à minha volta e O que está à minha frente.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
